    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0809" n="713" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg713"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Spanish minister has to-day paid ninety-eight and ninety-nine instalments
                    interest in thirty-four bonds, twenty-eight thousand five hundred each. These
                    are accepted in full satisfaction of arrears. Express gratification.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
